# "Whenever one or more permanent cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere ... remove a -1/-1 counter."
# Faithless Looting discards two Islands at once: one event, one counter. Looting itself is a sorcery and adds none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mountain
Moonshadow
Faithless Looting
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Moonshadow.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Moonshadow.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 6
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island)
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Moonshadow.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Moonshadow.Power = 2
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
